{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>From Kivrot HaTa'avah they journeyed.</b> On the twenty-second of Sivan." "<b>And they were in Hatzerot.</b> It should have said 'and they encamped in Hatzerot,' as in all the other encampments — except that when they journeyed from Hatzerot they did not manage to go on before they heard that Miriam had spoken against Moses and was stricken with tzara'at, and they turned back and encamped behind them in Hatzerot until Miriam was gathered in, and there is no earlier and later (in the verse)."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:39.226104048Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}